// Syncthing ignore list for the adjacent storage root. sync.sh copies this file to
// <root>/.stignore, because Syncthing never syncs .stignore itself.
// Syncthing also skips .stfolder.
//
// Live state is owned by the execution host and refuses foreign paths:
/.sentinel
/projects/*/threads
/projects/*/sessions
/projects/*/assignments
/projects/*/specs/*/runtime
// Journey QA run output holds harness session files (database URLs):
/projects/*/captures/*/ux-qa/runs
// Retired Phoenix data (SQLite with WAL), at the root and per workspace:
/.adjacent
/projects/*/.adjacent
// Machine-local files:
(?d).DS_Store
*.lock
*.tmp
*.sqlite*
.workspace-publish-*
.syncthing.*
//
// Not ignored on purpose: projects/*/specs/*/locations.json. The execution host
// writes it with its own absolute paths; other machines only view it, because
// spec work there refuses with wrong-host.
